<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 4 Best in Slot Gear list for Arms Warrior DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Icecrown Citadel. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 4</h2>While Arms Warrior has a wide variety of stats it can use, we want to mostly focus on the following priority<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hit - Aim for 8% hit rating, but being a couple of decimals off of a perfect cap can be ok in some situations.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Armor Penetration Rating - With the abundance of ArP Rating available, hard capping ArP (at 1400 rating) is one of our highest priorities. Arms Warriors only need 1260 rating from gear due to a passive 10% ArP, which should be our priority to gem until Cap</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Strength - Strength is a Arms Warrior's primary stat, and gives 2 base AP per point of Strength. As one of our strongest stats, this will be our primary stat to look for/<wbr/>gem whenever you are unsure of any other stat to pick up.</div></li></ol>
