<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 4</h3>By far the most notable option here is the new 25HC Trinket, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50363/deathbringers-will">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deathbringer's Will</span></a>. The second biggest DPS for us behind a weapon, this trinket is <i>essential</i> for hitting our ArP cap in both P4 and P5. If you can't get Shadowmourne, use everything in your power to get priority on this trinket. The Ruby Sanctum Trinket, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54590/sharpened-twilight-scale">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubysanctum4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sharpened Twilight Scale</span></a>, is our second strongest option, and is the more consistent of the two, due to its lower CD.<br/>
<br/>For a second trinket, both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47131/deaths-verdict">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Verdict</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50343/whispering-fanged-skull">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Whispering Fanged Skull</span></a> are very comparable and come out within sub 30 DPS of each other. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47131/deaths-verdict">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Verdict</span></a> inches out the ICC trinket earlier, however (as well as always being ahead for horde), and is substantially better in the case that you do not get a Shadowmourne. The Normal version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47131/deaths-verdict">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Verdict</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47115/deaths-verdict">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death's Verdict</span></a>, is very easy to get now due to its vendor status; try to pick this up if you don't have the Heroic Version already.<div class="pad"></div>
