<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 4</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-arms-warrior-dps-in-phase-4">Two Handed Weapons for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 4</h4>Finally, our moment arrives. <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49623/shadowmourne">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_113.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowmourne</span></a> is the legendary Melee DPS weapon of the expansion, and it is a truly stunning weapon. With three sockets, the highest stats in the game, and a strong proc, this item should be every Warrior's primary goal from ICC. <br/>
<br/>However, for those of us that aren't lucky enough to recieve this item, there are other options, as well as a variety of offhands to choose from. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50735/oathbinder-charge-of-the-ranger-general">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_staff_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Oathbinder, Charge of the Ranger-General</span></a> is the best 284 Two handed weapon from Heroic Lich King for Arms, as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50730/glorenzelg-high-blade-of-the-silver-hand">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_153.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glorenzelg, High-Blade of the Silver Hand</span></a> overcaps our expertise quite heavily in addition to being a sword. Before this weapon is obtained, a few 277 or 264 weapons are also good choices.<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=59621/enchant-weapon-berserking">
